<title>CROATIA: Croatia M1, M4 money supply rises in April.</title>
<headline>Croatia M1, M4 money supply rises in April.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MONEY SUPPLY	   APRIL	 MARCH     APRIL '96</p>
<p> Reserve money (million HRK) 8,591.9     8,420.0     6,664.2</p>
<p> M1 money supply		11,405.9    10,995.0     8,755.8</p>
<p> Broadest money M4	    40,596.4    39,292.1    28,236.9</p>
<p>NOTE -- April reserve money rose 2.04 percent from March and M1 rose 3.74 percent. M4 or total liquid assets rose 3.32 percent. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
